    {
      "section": "A",
      "text": "W25Q16 flash with C14 decoupling. QSPI_* and +3V3 link to U1 on sheet Core."
    },
    {
      "section": "B",
      "text": "BOOTSEL: hold SW1 at power-up (QSPI_SS to GND through 1k). RESET: SW2 pulls RUN to GND. GPIO25 drives the LED through R5."
    },
    {
      "section": "C",
      "text": "3-pin SWD header: SWCLK, SWDIO, GND, linked to sheet Core."
